sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Gateway as Platform Gateway<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant AuthProxy as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Predictor as Predictor Pod<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant EPP as Scheduler/EPP<br/>gRPC mTLS
    participant vLLM as vLLM Workload<br/>8000/TCP HTTP/HTTPS
    participant StorageInit as storage-initializer<br/>(Init Container)
    participant S3 as Remote Storage<br/>S3/GCS/Azure/HF<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Router as InferenceGraph Router<br/>8080/TCP HTTP/HTTPS
    participant StepSvc as Inference Step Services

    Note over Client,Predictor: Flow 1: InferenceService (Raw Deployment Mode)
    Client->>Gateway: POST /v1/models/{model}:predict<br/>HTTPS/443 TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    Gateway->>AuthProxy: HTTPRoute → Service<br/>HTTP/8443
    AuthProxy->>K8sAPI: SubjectAccessReview<br/>HTTPS/443 TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>AuthProxy: SAR Result (allow/deny)
    AuthProxy->>Predictor: Forward request<br/>HTTP/8080 (localhost)
    Predictor-->>AuthProxy: Prediction result
    AuthProxy-->>Gateway: Response
    Gateway-->>Client: JSON Response<br/>HTTPS/443

    Note over Client,vLLM: Flow 2: LLMInferenceService (Gateway API Inference Extension)
    Client->>Gateway: POST /v1/completions<br/>HTTPS/443 TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    Gateway->>EPP: Endpoint selection query<br/>gRPC mTLS (Istio)
    EPP-->>Gateway: Selected endpoint (vLLM pod)
    Gateway->>vLLM: Forward to selected pod<br/>HTTP(S)/8000<br/>Optional TLS
    vLLM-->>Gateway: LLM Response (streaming)
    Gateway-->>Client: Response<br/>HTTPS/443

    Note over StorageInit,S3: Flow 3: Storage Initialization (Pod Startup)
    StorageInit->>S3: Download model artifacts<br/>HTTPS/443 TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: AWS IAM / GCP SA / HF token
    S3-->>StorageInit: Model artifacts
    StorageInit->>StorageInit: Write to local PVC<br/>(filesystem)

    Note over Client,StepSvc: Flow 4: InferenceGraph Routing
    Client->>Router: POST inference request<br/>HTTP(S)/8080<br/>Auth: Optional Bearer token
    Router->>K8sAPI: TokenReview + SAR<br/>HTTPS/443 TLS 1.2+
    K8sAPI-->>Router: Auth result
    Router->>StepSvc: Route to step services<br/>(splitter/switch/ensemble/sequence)<br/>HTTP (in-mesh)
    StepSvc-->>Router: Step results
    Router->>StepSvc: Next step (if sequence/ensemble)
    StepSvc-->>Router: Final result
    Router-->>Client: Aggregated response
